{"seq":3,"slug":"gang-scheduling-queue-fairness","title":"批调度、队列配额与抢占（gang scheduling）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/gpu-scheduling-topology/gang-scheduling-queue-fairness","wordCount":2191,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"批调度-队列配额与抢占-gang-scheduling\">批调度、队列配额与抢占（gang scheduling）</h1><p>一个 64 卡的分布式训练任务被拆成 16 个 worker Pod，通过 <code>torchrun</code> 互相 <code>all-reduce</code>。kube-scheduler 按顺序逐个调度：前 60 个顺利绑定，剩下 4 个因集群只剩 2 张空闲卡而永久 <code>Pending</code>。最坏的情况不是&quot;排队等一会&quot;，而是<strong>那 60 张卡被死死占住</strong>——每个 worker 都卡在 <code>Waiting for initial process group</code> 忙等，既不出结果也不释放资源。这种&quot;部分启动&quot;的死锁是 gang scheduling（成组调度）要解决的第一性问题，其与普通优先级抢占最本质的区别是：<strong>普通抢占关心&quot;谁能拿到资源&quot;，成组调度还要回答&quot;拿不全时是否一张都不拿&quot;</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-扩展资源计数为什么不够\">核心概念：扩展资源计数为什么不够</h2><p>成组调度要解决的是&quot;全有或全无&quot;的原子性。前一篇 <a href=\"extended-resource-scheduling\">扩展资源请求与 GPU 调度模型</a> 已证明：调度器眼里的 GPU 只是不透明整数计数器，它按 Pod 逐个做 <code>NodeResourcesFit</code>，<strong>不存在&quot;这一批 Pod 要么全上、要么全不上&quot;的概念</strong>。分布式训练恰恰要求这个语义，因为 NCCL 集合通信是同步屏障——任一 worker 没起来，其余都会阻塞。设任务需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个 Pod、集群剩余容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可用</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>全部 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> 个就绪</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>全部阻塞（死锁）</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可用} = \\begin{cases} \\text{全部 } n \\text{ 个就绪}, &amp; c \\ge n \\\\ \\text{全部阻塞（死锁）}, &amp; 0 &lt; c &lt; n \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可用</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全部</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个就绪</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全部阻塞（死锁）</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>中间这个 <code>0 &lt; c &lt; n</code> 区间才是灾难——它不产生任何有效计算，却把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 张卡永久锁死。成组调度把它直接抹掉，退化成二值的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\ge n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 判断：资源不够就<strong>整体 <code>Pending</code>，一张卡都不占</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;Job: 16 workers × 1 GPU&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;成组调度器&lt;br/&gt;资源是否 ≥ minMember？&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是:满足 gang&quot;| C[&quot;一次性预留 16 张卡&lt;br/&gt;全部进入 permit 阶段&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否:不足&quot;| D[&quot;整个 PodGroup Pending&lt;br/&gt;不占用任何 GPU&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E{&quot;有 worker 崩溃？&quot;}&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G[&quot;PodGroup 进入 unknown&lt;br/&gt;控制器重建全部成员&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| H[&quot;训练正常收敛&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; I[&quot;队列等待或触发抢占评估&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[\"Job: 16 workers × 1 GPU\"] --&gt; B{\"成组调度器&lt;br/&gt;资源是否 ≥ minMember？\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"是:满足 gang\"| C[\"一次性预留 16 张卡&lt;br/&gt;全部进入 permit 阶段\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"否:不足\"| D[\"整个 PodGroup Pending&lt;br/&gt;不占用任何 GPU\"]\n  C --&gt; E{\"有 worker 崩溃？\"}\n  E --&gt;|\"是\"| G[\"PodGroup 进入 unknown&lt;br/&gt;控制器重建全部成员\"]\n  E --&gt;|\"否\"| H[\"训练正常收敛\"]\n  D --&gt; I[\"队列等待或触发抢占评估\"]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><p>这里还要区分两个极易混淆的层级：<strong>Pod 级优先级抢占</strong>（<code>PriorityClass</code> + <code>preemptionPolicy</code>）解决单个 Pod 的插队问题，而 <strong>gang scheduling 解决 Pod 集合的原子性问题</strong>。〔<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/pod-priority-preemption/\">Pod Priority and Preemption</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"volcano-podgroup-与五段式动作流水线\">Volcano：PodGroup 与五段式动作流水线</h2><p>Volcano 是第一个把成组调度做进生产环境的开源批调度器，核心抽象是 <strong>PodGroup</strong>——把若干 Pod 声明为&quot;必须一起成功或一起失败&quot;的 CRD。关键字段直接决定行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>minMember</code></td>\n<td>integer</td>\n<td>组成员至少多少个就绪才允许调度（即 gang 的闸门）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>minResources</code></td>\n<td>resource map</td>\n<td>组整体所需的最小资源，如 <code>nvidia.com/gpu: &quot;16&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>queue</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>所属队列，必须处于 <code>Open</code> 状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>priorityClassName</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>组优先级，调度器据此在队列内排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>PodGroup.status.phase</code> 语义精确：<code>pending</code>（已接受但资源未满足）、<code>inqueue</code>（等待绑定）、<code>running</code>（至少 <code>minMember</code> 个成员在跑）、<code>unknown</code>（<strong>部分在跑、部分排不上队</strong>）。最后这个 <code>unknown</code> 就是死锁在调度器视角的投影，Volcano 把它交给 ControllerManager 重建全部成员兜底。〔<a href=\"https://volcano.sh/en/docs/podgroup/\">Volcano PodGroup</a>〕Volcano 调度器是<strong>五段式动作流水线</strong>，按配置顺序执行，且<strong>不校验这个顺序是否合理</strong>——顺序错了会出现诡异行为：<code>enqueue</code> 筛选任务并从 pending 迁到 inqueue；<code>allocate</code> 选节点并预留资源；<code>preempt</code> 做同队列内高优抢占低优；<code>reclaim</code> 在队列拿不到足够资源时按权重从其他队列回收；<code>backfill</code> 把 pending 任务塞进节点空隙提升利用率。成组语义由 <strong><code>gang</code> 插件</strong>强制：它优先处理未就绪的任务，在尝试驱逐与回收后，<strong>验证队列资源是否足以支撑 <code>minavailable</code> 个 Pod；只有够了才放行</strong>。〔<a href=\"https://volcano.sh/en/docs/schduler_introduction/\">Volcano Scheduler</a>〕〔<a href=\"https://volcano.sh/en/docs/plugins/\">Volcano Plugins</a>〕注意插件描述用 <code>minavailable</code>、PodGroup 字段叫 <code>minMember</code>——同一概念的两个名字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kueue-clusterqueue-cohort-的配额-借还与抢占\">Kueue：ClusterQueue / Cohort 的配额、借还与抢占</h2><p>Kueue 走了另一条路：<strong>不改调度器</strong>，而是在 Pod 创建之前做一道准入闸门——&quot;先排队拿配额，拿到了才让 Pod 存在&quot;。四层对象构成配额体系：<strong>ResourceFlavor</strong>（一类可用资源，通常绑定节点特征如 GPU 卡型）、<strong>ClusterQueue</strong>（集群级资源池，定义用量上限与公平共享规则）、<strong>LocalQueue</strong>（命名空间级租户入口）、<strong>Cohort</strong>（一组 ClusterQueue，彼此可<strong>借用对方闲置的配额</strong>）。配额表达是三层嵌套：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta2&#10;kind: ClusterQueue&#10;spec:&#10;  cohort: gpu-shared # 加入共享池，可借还&#10;  queueingStrategy: StrictFIFO # 或 BestEffortFIFO&#10;  resourceGroups:&#10;    - coveredResources: [&#39;nvidia.com/gpu&#39;]&#10;      flavors:&#10;        - name: h100&#10;          resources:&#10;            - name: nvidia.com/gpu&#10;              nominalQuota: 64 # 保底&#10;              borrowingLimit: 32 # 借入上限&#10;              lendingLimit: 16 # 借出上限&#10;  preemption:&#10;    reclaimWithinCohort: LowerPriority&#10;    withinClusterQueue: LowerPriority&#10;    borrowWithinCohort: { policy: LowerPriority, maxPriorityThreshold: 100 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterQueue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cohort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gpu-shared</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 加入共享池，可借还</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  queueingStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">StrictFIFO</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 或 BestEffortFIFO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resourceGroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">coveredResources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nvidia.com/gpu'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      flavors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">h100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nvidia.com/gpu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              nominalQuota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 保底</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              borrowingLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 借入上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              lendingLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 借出上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  preemption</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reclaimWithinCohort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LowerPriority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    withinClusterQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LowerPriority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    borrowWithinCohort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LowerPriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">maxPriorityThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>nominalQuota</code> 是&quot;保底&quot;，<code>borrowingLimit</code> 是&quot;上限&quot;，两者之差就是队列在别人空闲时能临时吃到的弹性空间。这正是训练池与推理池共卡的工程价值：<strong>推理池白天需求高、训练池夜间需求高，通过同一个 Cohort 互相借还，把两套峰值拉平到一套容量上</strong>。〔<a href=\"https://kueue.sigs.k8s.io/docs/concepts/cluster_queue/\">Kueue ClusterQueue</a>〕抢占的三个开关各管一件事：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开关</th>\n<th>管什么</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>withinClusterQueue</code></td>\n<td>同队列内抢占</td>\n<td>本队列工作负载按优先级让位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reclaimWithinCohort</code></td>\n<td>收回被借走的配额</td>\n<td>借出方要用回自己的 <code>nominalQuota</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>borrowWithinCohort</code></td>\n<td>从 cohort 中再抢更多</td>\n<td>保底不够，还要越过 <code>nominalQuota</code> 往上占</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Fair Sharing 遵守前两个，但<strong>明确不遵守 <code>borrowWithinCohort</code></strong>。〔<a href=\"https://kueue.sigs.k8s.io/docs/concepts/preemption/\">Kueue Preemption</a>〕调度单元是 <strong>Workload</strong>，它从 Job 的 PodTemplate 推导出 <code>podSets</code>，并在 <code>status.schedulingStats.evictions[]</code> 里按 <code>reason</code>、<code>underlyingCause</code> 计数驱逐——排查&quot;任务为什么反复重启&quot;的第一手数据。当前文档站指向 <strong>v1beta2</strong> API。〔<a href=\"https://kueue.sigs.k8s.io/docs/overview/\">Kueue Overview</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"队列配额与公平性-drf-proportion-与权重的算术\">队列配额与公平性：DRF、proportion 与权重的算术</h2><p>配额不能只靠&quot;每个队列固定多少卡&quot;来切，因为任务对 CPU、内存、GPU 的配比差异巨大。Volcano 的 <strong>DRF（Dominant Resource Fairness）</strong> 插件比较抢占者与候选者的资源占用，<strong>给占用更少的一方更高优先级</strong>。核心是&quot;主导份额&quot;——一个用户对某项资源的占用占集群该资源总量的比例，取所有资源中的最大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>share</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>alloc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>capacity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{share}(u) = \\max_{r \\in R} \\frac{\\text{alloc}(u, r)}{\\text{capacity}(r)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">share</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">capacity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">alloc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>调度器持续把资源从主导份额高的一方转给低的一方，直到所有人趋于相等。这让 DRF 适合混合负载集群：一个只用 GPU 的训练任务和一个只用 CPU 的预处理任务，不会被简单按&quot;卡数&quot;或&quot;核数&quot;比较，而是各自看最紧张的那一项。<strong>proportion 插件</strong>则在队列之间按权重分配应得资源：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>deserved</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>weight</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>weight</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>total</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{deserved}(q) = \\frac{\\text{weight}(q)}{\\sum_{i} \\text{weight}(i)} \\times \\text{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deserved</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4127em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Volcano 的 Queue 上有三个易混字段：<code>weight</code>（决定 deserved 与 reclaim 份额）、<code>capability</code>（硬上限，超过即不可再分）、<code>guarantee</code>（保底，必须 ≤ deserved），另有 <code>reclaimable</code>（默认 <code>true</code>）与 <code>priority</code>。队列状态为 <code>Open</code> / <code>Closed</code> / <code>Closing</code> / <code>Unknown</code>，只有 <code>Open</code> 接收新任务。〔<a href=\"https://volcano.sh/en/docs/queue/\">Volcano Queue</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"原生-kep-4671-内建成组调度的时间线\">原生 KEP-4671：内建成组调度的时间线</h2><p>外部调度器虽然成熟，但代价是<strong>要替换或旁路 kube-scheduler</strong>，运维复杂。KEP-4671 因此把成组调度做进上游：<code>Workload</code> 定义静态 <code>podGroupTemplates</code>（最多 8 个），<code>PodGroup</code> 是运行时调度对象，Pod 通过 <code>spec.schedulingGroup.podGroupName</code> 引用自己的组。<code>GangSchedulingPolicy</code> 只有一个字段 <strong><code>minCount</code></strong>——必须一起&quot;可调度或被调度&quot;的最小 Pod 数。Alpha 插件用两个扩展点实现屏障：<code>PreEnqueue</code> 要求 PodGroup 存在且至少观察到 <code>minCount</code> 个成员，否则返回 <code>UnschedulableAndUnresolvable</code>；<code>WaitOnPermit</code> 等到组内所有 Pod 都到达 permit 阶段才允许绑定。Beta 则从<strong>同一个集群快照</strong>调度整个 PodGroup，并加入 <code>PlacementFeasible</code> 扩展点与 workload-aware 抢占（KEP-5710）。时间线：<strong>v1.35 进入 Alpha</strong>；v1.36 保持 Alpha 并引入解耦的 <code>v1alpha2</code> 模型；Beta <strong>后延至 v1.37</strong>（两个 gate 合并为单一 <code>GenericWorkload</code>）；API 计划 <strong>v1.38 提升为 <code>v1</code></strong>。〔<a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/master/keps/sig-scheduling/4671-gang-scheduling/README.md\">KEP-4671</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练池与推理池-队列设计的工程取舍\">训练池与推理池：队列设计的工程取舍</h2><p><strong>第一，训练池用 gang + 硬配额，推理池用非抢占优先级。</strong> 训练任务必须成组且对资源抖动极度敏感（一次抢占就是几小时的检查点损失），给它独立的 ClusterQueue 与 <code>nominalQuota</code> 并开启 <code>withinClusterQueue</code> 抢占；推理任务则用 <strong><code>preemptionPolicy: Never</code></strong> 的 PriorityClass——这类 Pod 排在低优 Pod 前面，但<strong>不驱逐任何正在运行的 Pod</strong>。〔<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/pod-priority-preemption/\">Pod Priority and Preemption</a>〕</p>\n<p><strong>第二，抢占的受害者按&quot;严格更低优先级&quot;筛选并优雅终止。</strong> 调度器先找一台&quot;移除若干严格低优 Pod 后能让高优 Pod 装得下&quot;的节点，写 <code>status.nominatedNodeName</code>，再执行 <code>preStop</code>、<code>SIGTERM</code>、<code>terminationGracePeriodSeconds</code>，超时 <code>SIGKILL</code>。<strong>PodDisruptionBudget 对调度器抢占不是硬闸门</strong>，只约束 Eviction API（如 <code>kubectl drain</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，拓扑感知要与成组调度叠加。</strong> Kueue 的 Topology-Aware Scheduling 用 <code>Topology</code> 描述层级（如 <code>cloud.provider.com/topology-rack</code>），ResourceFlavor 通过 <code>.spec.topologyName</code> 引用它；<code>kueue.x-k8s.io/podset-required-topology</code> 要求所有 Pod 落在同一域内，<code>podset-preferred-topology</code> 逐级放宽。该特性自 Kueue v0.14 起 <strong>Beta 并默认启用</strong>。〔<a href=\"https://kueue.sigs.k8s.io/docs/concepts/topology_aware_scheduling/\">Kueue TAS</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><strong>Volcano</strong> 用 PodGroup + 五段式流水线给出最完整的批调度语义，代价是替换调度器；<strong>Kueue</strong> 用 ClusterQueue / Cohort 把配额与借还做成调度器之前的准入闸门，不动 kube-scheduler，最适合多租户共享 GPU 池；<strong>native KEP-4671</strong> 正把成组调度做进上游。选型链：是否必须全有或全无 → 要 gang；是否共享同批卡 → 要配额与借还；是否跨机架 → 要拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排障清单\">排障清单</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Pod 长期 Pending 但集群有空卡</strong> → 看 PodGroup 的 <code>phase</code> 与 <code>conditions</code>，<code>NotEnoughResources</code> 通常意味着 <code>minMember</code> 比集群单次可提供的量大，要降 gang 规模或扩池。</li>\n<li><strong>Pod 进入 Failed 且原因 <code>UnexpectedAdmissionError</code></strong> → device plugin 的 <code>Allocate</code> 在绑定阶段失败，与成组调度无关，去 kubelet 日志找 gRPC 错误。</li>\n<li><strong>任务被反复驱逐</strong> → 读 Kueue Workload 的 <code>status.schedulingStats.evictions[]</code>，按 <code>reason</code> 与 <code>underlyingCause</code> 分类，判断是配额不足还是借还被收回。</li>\n<li><strong>有额度却分不到卡</strong> → 检查 <code>guarantee ≤ deserved ≤ capability</code> 与队列是否为 <code>Open</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批调度、队列配额与抢占（gang scheduling）","id":"批调度-队列配额与抢占-gang-scheduling"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：扩展资源计数为什么不够","id":"核心概念-扩展资源计数为什么不够"},{"level":2,"text":"Volcano：PodGroup 与五段式动作流水线","id":"volcano-podgroup-与五段式动作流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"Kueue：ClusterQueue / Cohort 的配额、借还与抢占","id":"kueue-clusterqueue-cohort-的配额-借还与抢占"},{"level":2,"text":"队列配额与公平性：DRF、proportion 与权重的算术","id":"队列配额与公平性-drf-proportion-与权重的算术"},{"level":2,"text":"原生 KEP-4671：内建成组调度的时间线","id":"原生-kep-4671-内建成组调度的时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"训练池与推理池：队列设计的工程取舍","id":"训练池与推理池-队列设计的工程取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"排障清单","id":"排障清单"}],"prev":{"title":"拓扑感知调度：NUMA、PCIe 与 NVLink 亲和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/gpu-scheduling-topology/topology-numa-pcie-nvlink"},"next":{"title":"GPU 共享模式：time-slicing、MPS 与 MIG 切分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/gpu-sharing-virtualization/sharing-modes-mig-partition"}}